{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105073","id":2441360082,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6RhDLS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105073","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105073.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105073.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105073","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105073/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105073/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105073/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e935fb1ee23c5f83ae03f4b91623b66324cd0a5d","number":105073,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix miscellaneous oddities around the class reference (part 4)","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Continuation of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104333\r\nI can't keep going with ever-so-slightly different names for these.\r\n\r\nThis PR addressed yet yet another huge chunk of class reference oddities I remembered to note down for later while localizing the class reference. Some of these are clear typos, some are inconsistencies, some are just awkward.\r\n\r\nOf particular note:\r\n- Modify **Dictionary**'s `sort()` substantially\r\n\t- For parity with **Array**'s corresponding method\r\n\t- ~Add an example and note which only makes sense if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105065 is merged first!~\r\n\t- Part of it could be summarized to _\"sorting the dictionary is useful if you need a dictionary to be sorted\"_. Yeah...\r\n\t- Please do not use `keys()` and `values()` methods as replacements for actual words. It's confusing and harder to localize\r\n- Modify **LookAtModifier3D**'s `is_interpolating()` substantially\r\n- Modify **FileAccess**'s leading description substantially\r\n\t- This was in the process of fixing `[b]` tags being used for *\"Alt + F4\"* instead of `[kbd]` tags\r\n- Replace singular use of \"niche\" with a more common word\r\n- Remove a barren *\"Example:\"* that [should not exist](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95749) and yet it does\r\n- Fix more `true` and `false` with `[code]` tags ([guys, come on](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95762))\r\n- Fix **EditorPlugin**'s `_forward_3d_draw_over_viewport` and `_forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport` not referencing their parameter properly\r\n- Fix **StreamPeer**'s `get_partial_data` not referencing their parameter properly\r\n- Fix more editor settings not being linked with a `[member]` tag","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhance